# The researcher tools' environment's own top-level packages, beyond
# ../core.in: what iris-view, iris-compare, the importer and rebuild need
# (#149). tools is no lab's environment (../README.md). tools/1 takes every
# pin from microct/1's lock, so iris-view behaves as it did there;
# 1/requirements.lock pins these and the core list. No PyTorch: no
# researcher tool imports it.

# netCDF-classic volume blocks, which iris-view opens
netCDF4

# Deflate for the label volume's BigTIFF, which iris-view reads
imagecodecs

# iris-view
napari[pyqt5]
